+# UI Specialist Gate Final Audit: APPROVED for KANBA-91 (KB-P3-12)
+
+- Auditor: ui-specialist (Swarm UI & UX Architecture Specialist Gate)
+- Worktree: `/tmp/kb-wt-KANBA-91`
